<div id="A10.Thmtheorem4.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A10.Thmtheorem4.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.Thmtheorem4.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A10.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A10.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The following lemma elucidates the property of <math id="A10.SS1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla\Phi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla\Phi</annotation></semantics></math>: it approximates the projection to the flat subspace.</p>
</div>
<div id="A10.Thmtheorem5" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A10.Thmtheorem5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma J.5</span></span><span id="A10.Thmtheorem5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Suppose Assumptions <a href="#S7.Thmtheorem1" title="Assumption 7.1 (River Structure). ‣ 7 Theoretical Analysis to Training Dynamics ‣ Accelerating LLM Pre-Training through Flat-Direction Dynamics Enhancement" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7.1</span></a> and <a href="#S7.Thmtheorem2" title="Assumption 7.2 (Regularity, Smoothness and Conservation). ‣ 7 Theoretical Analysis to Training Dynamics ‣ Accelerating LLM Pre-Training through Flat-Direction Dynamics Enhancement" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7.2</span></a> hold, and</span></p>
<table id="A10.E98" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A10.E98.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu_{1}:=\lambda_{H_{F},s}-\frac{3}{2}\delta_{F_{s}}\geq 0,\quad 2\delta\lambda_{F_{s}}^{-1}\frac{1}{\gamma}\left(1+\frac{\delta_{F_{s}}}{2\mu_{1}}\right)\leq\frac{1}{2\rho}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>γ</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>δ</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_{1}:=\lambda_{H_{F},s}-\frac{3}{2}\delta_{F_{s}}\geq 0,\quad 2\delta\lambda_{F_{s}}^{-1}\frac{1}{\gamma}\left(1+\frac{\delta_{F_{s}}}{2\mu_{1}}\right)\leq\frac{1}{2\rho}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(98)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Define</span></p>
<table id="A10.E99" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A10.E99.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon_{\Phi}=\frac{4\delta\kappa_{F_{s}}}{\gamma+\mu_{1}}+\frac{4\kappa_{F_{s}}^{2}\delta}{\gamma}\left(1+\frac{\delta_{F_{s}}}{2\mu_{1}}\right)\left(1+\frac{2\delta}{\gamma+\mu_{1}}\right)+\frac{2\delta_{F_{s}}\kappa_{F_{s}}}{\mu_{1}}\left(1+\frac{2\delta}{\gamma+\mu_{1}}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mi>γ</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>δ</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></msub></mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon_{\Phi}=\frac{4\delta\kappa_{F_{s}}}{\gamma+\mu_{1}}+\frac{4\kappa_{F_{s}}^{2}\delta}{\gamma}\left(1+\frac{\delta_{F_{s}}}{2\mu_{1}}\right)\left(1+\frac{2\delta}{\gamma+\mu_{1}}\right)+\frac{2\delta_{F_{s}}\kappa_{F_{s}}}{\mu_{1}}\left(1+\frac{2\delta}{\gamma+\mu_{1}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(99)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Then for any <math id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w\in U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w\in U</annotation></semantics></math> and any vector <math id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\in\mathbb{R}^{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\in\mathbb{R}^{p}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A10.E100" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A10.E100.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\|P_{s}(\Phi(w))\nabla\Phi(w)v\|_{F(\Phi(w))}\leq\frac{\epsilon_{\Phi}}{2}\|v\|_{F(\Phi(w))}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>v</mi><msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">∥</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.0835em">≤</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>v</mi><msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|P_{s}(\Phi(w))\nabla\Phi(w)v\|_{F(\Phi(w))}\leq\frac{\epsilon_{\Phi}}{2}\|v\|_{F(\Phi(w))},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(100)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A10.E101" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A10.E101.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\|P_{f}(\Phi(w))\nabla\Phi(w)v-P_{f}(w)v\|_{F(\Phi(w))}\leq\frac{\epsilon_{\Phi}}{2}\|v\|_{F(\Phi(w))}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>v</mi><msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">∥</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.0835em">≤</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>v</mi><msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">∥</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.0835em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|P_{f}(\Phi(w))\nabla\Phi(w)v-P_{f}(w)v\|_{F(\Phi(w))}\leq\frac{\epsilon_{\Phi}}{2}\|v\|_{F(\Phi(w))}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(101)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Thus</span></p>
<table id="A10.E102" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A10.E102.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\nabla\Phi(w)v-P_{f}(w)v\|_{F(\Phi(w))}\leq\epsilon_{\Phi}\|v\|_{F(\Phi(w))}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\nabla\Phi(w)v-P_{f}(w)v\|_{F(\Phi(w))}\leq\epsilon_{\Phi}\|v\|_{F(\Phi(w))}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(102)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A10.Thmtheorem5.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Define</span></p>
<table id="A10.E103" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A10.E103.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{t}=P_{s}(\psi_{t}(w))\partial_{w}\psi_{t}(w)[v],\quad r_{t}=P_{f}(\psi_{t}(w))\partial_{w}\psi_{t}(w)[v]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∂</mo><mi>w</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∂</mo><mi>w</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{t}=P_{s}(\psi_{t}(w))\partial_{w}\psi_{t}(w)[v],\quad r_{t}=P_{f}(\psi_{t}(w))\partial_{w}\psi_{t}(w)[v].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(103)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">It implies that <math id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{t}+r_{t}=\partial_{w}\psi_{t}(w)[v]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∂</mo><mi>w</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{t}+r_{t}=\partial_{w}\psi_{t}(w)[v]</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{0}+r_{0}=v" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{0}+r_{0}=v</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{t\to\infty}h_{t}+\lim_{t\to\infty}r_{t}=\nabla\Phi(w)[v]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{t\to\infty}h_{t}+\lim_{t\to\infty}r_{t}=\nabla\Phi(w)[v]</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">We compute the time derivative of <math id="A10.Thmtheorem5.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|h_{t}\|_{F}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|h_{t}\|_{F}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="A10.E104" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A10.E104X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
