<p id="A10.Thmtheorem10.p8.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.Thmtheorem10.p8.2.1" class="ltx_text">where the last inequality uses (<a href="#A10.E145" title="Equation 145 ‣ Lemma J.9. ‣ J.2 Dynamics Analysis ‣ Appendix J Proof ‣ Accelerating LLM Pre-Training through Flat-Direction Dynamics Enhancement" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">145</span></a>), Lemma (<a href="#A10.Thmtheorem8" title="Lemma J.8. ‣ J.2 Dynamics Analysis ‣ Appendix J Proof ‣ Accelerating LLM Pre-Training through Flat-Direction Dynamics Enhancement" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">J.8</span></a>) and (<a href="#A10.E102" title="Equation 102 ‣ Lemma J.5. ‣ J.1 Landscape Analysis ‣ Appendix J Proof ‣ Accelerating LLM Pre-Training through Flat-Direction Dynamics Enhancement" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">102</span></a>). It follows that</span></p>
</div>
